flowchart TD
  A["Reviewed issue + source SHA + task digest + confirmation"]
  B["GitHub user ID allowlist + live write permission"]
  C["Exact staging ref and SHA + bounded issue snapshot"]
  D["Atomic request ref: duplicate or uncertain means STOP"]
  E["Check-in receipt / owner-main pointer / context unavailable"]
  F["Existing binding + read-only sandbox preflight / failure STOP"]
  G["One Codex call / isolated branch / 45-minute timeout"]
  H["Actual exit + source recheck / draft PR only"]
  I["Check-out / Ruby pending / no Green retention or deployment"]
  A --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D
  D --> E
  E --> F
  F --> G
  G --> H
  H --> I
